# L §3.1 (round 12): "A leg is a field only of an observed row (§5.19), never of a record (LOAD-FIELD)". (Was
# REFCORE-UNSPECIFIED §3.1, writer 5's T-6.)
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-18
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place shop: outside lives 2026-01-01..
input d: date
def r: (on date) = (on: d, leg cash from konto to shop amount 1.00 PLN)
ask q: r.on
=== expect
refused: LOAD-FIELD leg cash: a leg is a field only of an observed row, not of a record (m.tally:12)
